                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a basic solitaire, with a Christmas theme. The normal kind of pc solitaire game, as many of the other games the same developer has done. Nice graphics and atmosphere. The music is good too, except for the really bad, very slowed down versions of peppy Christmas songs. Except for those the music was very nice to have playing throughout the game. \n\nThe advancement in the game is based on a Advent calendar (24 doors) each door has 10 boards of solitaire in them, which you have to complete to move on. So there are 240 total boards of solitaire to enjoy. You gain \"money\" as you play to buy all kinds of things to help your game play as well. There is a story that is told as you go through the game, these are shown at the opening of each new door.\n\nI recommend the game if you like to play solitaire and with the theme it is best played at Christmas time for some relaxing fun. I rate it a 7/10",
